<title>UK: Wet Brent trades lower at April -71 cts - trade.</title>
<headline>Wet Brent trades lower at April -71 cts - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>A cargo of Brent blend was sold lower on Friday at a 71 cent discount to April Brent, traders said.</p>
<p>The differential for the March 26-28 loader was seven cents under that achieved for a cargo loading March 25-27 that was sold on Thursday at April -64 cents, they said.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
